ad walls, and a fallaway. Plus, it’s great for catching some air!","sport":"SNOW","difficulty":"BLACK_DIAMOND","primaryActivity":null,"groomed":"GROOMED","createdTimestamp":1765987490130,"reportedTimestamp":1773173738552,"name":"Werner's Way","resortIdSport":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455SNOW"},{"resortId":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455","createdTimestamp":1765987487339,"status":"CLOSED","name":"South Park","geojson":"{\"type\":\"FeatureCollection\",\"features\":[{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"South Park\"},\"geometry\":{\"coordinates\":[[-88.2262265,43.4956354],[-88.224195,43.4956508]],\"type\":\"LineString\"}}]}","allowedActivities":["DOWNHILL_SKI"],"userId":"ee8facb0-e186-11e7-b8fc-3735434746dd","description":"Perfect for intermediate to advanced boarders, this terrain park is the perfect place to practice some sweet tricks. With jumps, spines, kickers, and a variety of rails — box rails, single rails, and double barrel rails — there’s so much to enjoy!","reportedTimestamp":1773173722255,"difficulty":"FREESTYLE_TERRAIN","sport":"SNOW","primaryActivity":null,"groomed":"GROOMED","resortIdSport":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455SNOW","id":"3dc4458a-eb08-4dab-951d-53e0f82bb904"},{"resortId":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455","status":"CLOSED","createdTimestamp":1765987487974,"id":"7a88bb04-082c-4ee7-b492-9447e0a92da3","difficulty":"GREEN_CIRCLE","allowedActivities":["DOWNHILL_SKI"],"userId":"ee8facb0-e186-11e7-b8fc-3735434746dd","sport":"SNOW","description":"The friendliest of all the hills! Dubbed after the original namesake of our resort, this run is the first stop for newbies. This sloped hill is filled with beginner terrain that’s easy to navigate and features a rope tow and carpet lift.","primaryActivity":null,"geojson":"{\"type\":\"FeatureCollection\",\"features\":[{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"Wunderberg\"},\"geometry\":{\"coordinates\":[[-88.2248785,43.4920417],[-88.2234728,43.4921772]],\"type\":\"LineString\"}}]}","groomed":"GROOMED","resortIdSport":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455SNOW","reportedTimestamp":1773173747168,"name":"Wunderberg"},{"resortId":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455","name":"Edelweiss","status":"CLOSED","description":"Meet Sunburst’s fan favorite! Perfect for intermediate skiers, this run has been around since 1961. It’s our oldest and largest hill! With a wide, steady pitch, it’s the best hill to achieve high speeds. Cruise down Edelweiss just once and it’s sure to become one of your favorites, too.","allowedActivities":["DOWNHILL_SKI"],"userId":"ee8facb0-e186-11e7-b8fc-3735434746dd","reportedTimestamp":1773173677067,"id":"bf5157ca-6c62-43e9-9c15-3ab64024c15c","sport":"SNOW","difficulty":"BLUE_SQUARE","primaryActivity":null,"groomed":"GROOMED","geojson":"{\"type\":\"FeatureCollection\",\"features\":[{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"Edelweiss\"},\"geometry\":{\"coordinates\":[[-88.2259588,43.4934409],[-88.2226898,43.4936848]],\"type\":\"LineString\"}}]}","resortIdSport":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455SNOW","createdTimestamp":1765987490242},{"resortId":"467150d0-e189-11e7-b9a1-f5fc27016455","name":"Freida's Run","status":"CLOSED","reportedTimestamp":1773173686173,"difficulty":"GREEN_CIRCLE","allowedActivities":["DOWNHILL_SKI"],"userId":"ee8facb0-e186-11e7-b8fc-3735434746dd","description":"Take a leisurely ride to the bottom of the hill. Named after the owner’s beloved mother, this beginner’s run offers multiple fall lines and the best snow on the hill. Whether you’re a beginner building up your skills or an intermediate skier wanting a warm up, this run is the easiest way down!","sport":"SNOW","createdTimestamp":1765987490116,"id":"d5a36cbc-1b62-4c58-bd07-df09a6e2dda3","primaryActivity":null,"groomed":"GROOMED","geojson":"{\"type\":\"FeatureCollection\",\"features\":[{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"Freida's Run\"},\"geometry\":{\"coordinates\":[[-88.2260348,43.4943215],[-88.2258992,43.494706],[-